    "extract": "Angry Mom is a 2015 South Korean television series starring Kim Hee-sun, Ji Hyun-woo, and Kim Yoo-jung. It aired on MBC from March 18 to May 7, 2015, on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 22:00 (KST) for 16 episodes. The screenplay won the Excellence Award at MBC's 2014 Script Contest.",
    "extract_html": "<p><i><b>Angry Mom</b></i> is a 2015 South Korean television series starring Kim Hee-sun, Ji Hyun-woo, and Kim Yoo-jung. It aired on MBC from March 18 to May 7, 2015, on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 22:00 (KST) for 16 episodes. The screenplay won the Excellence Award at MBC's 2014 Script Contest.</p>"
